      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b1fa00b6-26eb-4156-abc7-54b6f4ac66e5",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Process cards: FIT\nspring before\nenergizing. SET\nlimit after",
                "fitting. TEST with\npower last. Card\norder is not a\nsuggestion. The",
                "inspector asks if\nthe wooden spoon\nis approved\nequipment. Rivet\nsays",
                "it is approved for\nmoving his ruler."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f403ccb9-0ac6-4cfb-a631-536f3ed44cbf",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "308479d3-a7d8-460a-aa43-4309d8d232b2",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The lock card adds\na condition to the\nprocess sheets:\nthe crew must",
                "disconnect power\nbefore opening the\nregulator cover.\nThe spring is",
                "fitted with the\ncover open. The\nlimit is set after\nthe spring is",
                "secured. The cover\nis then shut\nbefore power\nreturns for\ntesting.",
                "Dot arranges blank\ncards on the desk\nand asks the\ninspector to keep",
                "his silver ruler\naway from all of\nthem."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3bf12aab-9e87-4abd-a20c-19f3f906f4fd",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "88d1700b-c1a5-4e5e-a708-16e0a571ab8e",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which pair of\nactions must be\ncompleted, in that\norder, before the",
                "powered test?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9da74414-b297-42a5-aa7a-b0f680bc1888",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "89707e8d-4520-4a25-a06e-4c76604d0023",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The inspector asks\nwhat happens if\none seal fails the\ntest. Rivet",
                "points to the\nsupply promise you\nmade, then asks\nDot to explain how",
                "the replacement\nreaches the bench."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7d74e560-f7a4-4101-a44b-25003deb373f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7da21085-ef32-48b3-a2f4-f4096d8facda",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The inspector has\nwritten OPEN, FIT,\nSET, CLOSE, TEST.\nSomething",
                "must happen before\nOPEN, and must\nremain in force\nthrough the",
                "open-cover work.\nWhich first action\nmakes this\nsequence safe?\nThis",
                "is a planning\ncheck, not a live\nswitch experiment.\nRivet will not",
                "open the machine\nuntil the written\norder accounts for\nthe lock card."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b935a131-3144-4000-a599-c794fe97c66a",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "161e0966-db7d-4c2a-aaf7-0a78ca04f29d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The inspector\nwatches three\ncycles, including\na loss of power.\nThe",
                "valve closes each\ntime. He signs a\nplain sheet. Slush\nwanted a",
                "certificate\nsuitable for a\nwall. Rivet wants\na record suitable\nfor",
                "the next person at\nthe bench."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
